      "audience": {
        "@type": "BusinessAudience",
        "name": "Irish businesses and industrial operators"
      },
      "description": "Roof-mounted, ground-mounted and hybrid commercial solar PV designed for return on investment. Typical payback 3-5 years. Includes full ESB Networks grid application, SEAI NDMG and Accelerated Capital Allowance grant management, and Safe Electric registered installation. Commercial solar grants range from EUR 2,700 to EUR 162,600, typically covering 20-30% of project cost. Local Power has delivered single-site commercial systems of 1 MW+."
